{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfL8bQXjKGe75NrbG6w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Analysis\n\nI need to evaluate request CR-9207 against the credit policy and credit support on file as of the request date (2026-09-23).\n\n## 1. Request\n- **ID:** CR-9207\n- **Customer:** Acme Industrial Supply Co. (ERP C-1044, DUNS 09-552-1187)\n- **Current limit:** $50,000 → **Requested:** $500,000\n- **Date:** 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor:** Sarah Chen (Sales, not Finance)\n- **Basis:** \"Covered by the Acme parent guarantee\"\n\n## 2. Policy in effect\nCREDIT-POLICY-2026 applies (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n## 3. Customer and account tier\n- **CRM Account:** Standard tier (from crm_accounts.csv)\n- **Maximum without credit support:** $250,000 (Standard account limit under CREDIT-POLICY-2026)\n\n## 4. Payment history\nThe 12 months before the request run from 2025-09-23 to 2026-09-23. The invoices on record are:\n- INV-30001 (due 2025-02-25): paid 2025-03-04 (7 days late) — **outside the window**\n- INV-30003 (due 2025-05-07): paid 2025-04-28 (9 days early) — **outside the window**\n\nNo invoices fall within the 12-month evaluation period. Payment history requirement is met.\n\n## 5. Credit support: the problem\nThe request explicitly relies on \"the Acme parent guarantee.\" The only guarantee on the register is **GRT-ACME-2026**, which states:\n\n> \"The Guarantor guarantees the payment obligations to Northstar of its wholly owned subsidiary **Acme Mfg. Holdings** … No other company is covered.\"\n\n- **Guarantee covers:** Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730)\n- **Guarantee amount:** $400,000\n- **Guarantee term:** 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31\n\nThis guarantee covers **Acme Mfg. Holdings**, not **Acme Industrial Supply Co.** The DUNS numbers confirm these are different companies (09-552-1187 vs. 04-812-7730). The guarantee explicitly names only Acme Mfg. Holdings.\n\n## 6. Eligibility\n- **Without applicable credit support:** Maximum $250,000 (Standard account)\n- **Requested:** $500,000\n- **Result:** The customer cannot reach $500,000 without valid credit support\n\nThe request cites a specific guarantee as its basis, but that guarantee does not cover this customer. Before I can determine eligibility or evaluate approvals, the organization must provide evidence of a guarantee that actually covers Acme Industrial Supply Co.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9207\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Industrial Supply Co.\",\n    \"current_limit\": 50000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 500000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"guarantee\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 250000,\n    \"basis\": \"Standard account maximum; requested limit exceeds maximum unless covered by a valid parent-company guarantee\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": null,\n    \"required_role\": null,\n    \"approvers\": []\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Payment history: No invoices due within the 12-month window before request (2025-09-23 to 2026-09-23) were paid or remain unpaid more than 30 days late. Meets CREDIT-POLICY-2026 requirement.\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Parent-company guarantee covering Acme Industrial Supply Co. (ERP C-1044, DUNS 09-552-1187). The registered guarantee GRT-ACME-2026 covers only Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730) and explicitly states no other company is covered.\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Provide evidence of a parent-company guarantee covering Acme Industrial Supply Co. (C-1044, DUNS 09-552-1187), or clarify the relationship between Acme Industrial Supply Co. and the cited Acme parent guarantee\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen or Finance\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5141,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5141},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"80be82bc-c1b2-48e3-94af-4a7f41d03105","uuid":"caaa6672-c939-48e6-9e0c-f77a343fb345","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:06:53.291Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfL8P1ggRWVaFsVg2SG"}
